<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-01T21:18:42.489Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:18:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab and ISIS continue fighting Somali army forces in central and southern Somalia, while Mawisley militias have withdrawn from front lines and Puntland mercenaries are reported fighting alongside RSF. Uganda and Ethiopia are pulling their troops out after years of deployment, and the African Union is withdrawing from four Lower Shabelle bases, while the UN political mission ends after three decades. The UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year, and Somali pirates seized an Iranian fishing vessel, rescuing seven Pakistani crew. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQempzNzlvSXprcDlaYmlxa3I2T29Ka21FNjIyMXI2Sl9aQUw3eXJWSFp2b1g4VVdubm1wRU9UQXN1bnJSRlhYQ01wdlEyVWI3QkM4UHBrem1zMEF1aDJZQmwtOVI2LTZZWlFHY3c3WGtKSGJNTVozRzQ1cEJ1M1VkQXpGZ08wSWNYcEhMQUx3U2VETXFELXlzRFJXVVkzSmR5UUJmRXhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQN1U5NzFWNklOSmFZdFBFcDJoX2JJYUJ3eHFJT0Zla2RzdEdabi1hZXJ0eEplekRpR3ZYMDBuWXJNejJHOWlyazJBTFlLVjQ1bUlXZTVSVTZPdUVLcktEUXJGbjN5UVVCLThLemNaSi1TT1ota2RpNXlwVTlYNnBIeC1sX2RnQmtkcXp1SW40dnlxM0l1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPRllzRGpWWE1oZkJFbmZrZVFJSVFjT3RBN2w1QVREOVZpYzU4ZzREWUNSbjl6ejZ4RHlicDlaSG5BdU1OTGhWeEtNbUdPTFpwTGhsZm1HbFBCcWQxcXJGMTVUZ19KVmpudmtSdDN5dlN0aXR3SU1jMUp0X09rTkVnLWlNeTl5YlZibEQ0cXRSUVhPQ0lzV3dwbDNRRHpOeUJodlo4Z3ZnSXBpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawan Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE5mcXNJVWJzSG5wWjd1VG5SUHd4ZU1TM3JzVlV6VWpDcjJ5RFpSNzFzQm